{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"[{\"title\":\"This Self-Proclaimed Goddess and Reincarnation in Another World!\",\"number\":1,\"airDate\":\"2016-01-14\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Gamer Kazuma dies in a freak accident, and is met in the afterlife by a crass goddess, Aqua.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/303867/5427421.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"この自称女神と異世界転生を!\"},{\"title\":\"An Explosion for This Chunibyo!\",\"number\":2,\"airDate\":\"2016-01-21\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"It's great for Kazuma that he brought Aqua along with him, but unlike in a game world, much is missing from his adventurer's lifestyle. No money, no equipment, and even fighting the lowest ranking monsters is a hard-fought battle. That's when they decide to recruit new party members.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/303867/5466059.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"この中二病に爆焔を!\"},{\"title\":\"A Panty Treasure in This Right Hand!\",\"number\":3,\"airDate\":\"2016-01-28\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"A low-grade goddess turned arch priest who works hard to acquire party trick skills, a disappointing arch wizard who can only unleash explosion magic once per day, and Kazuma himself, whose only redeeming quality is his good luck. Kazuma despairs over the completely useless party that's been formed.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/303867/5466060.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"この右手にお宝[ぱんつ]を!\"},{\"title\":\"Explosion Magic for This Formidable Enemy!\",\"number\":4,\"airDate\":\"2016-02-04\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"All of the weak monsters have gone into hiding since a leader of the devil king's army has settled in near town. Kazuma, who had been focusing on improving his skills, is stuck at a standstill. With nothing else to do, Kazuma tags along with Megumin's training, which consists of unleashing explosion magic into an abandoned castle.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/303867/5466061.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"この強敵に爆裂魔法を!\"},{\"title\":\"A Price for This Cursed Sword!\",\"number\":5,\"airDate\":\"2016-02-11\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Wanting to earn some money despite only hard quests being available, Aqua takes on a request to purify a lake filled with alligator monsters, with the others putting her in a cage to keep her safe.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/303867/5466062.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"この魔剣にお値段を!\"},{\"title\":\"A Conclusion to This Worthless Fight!\",\"number\":6,\"airDate\":\"2016-02-18\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Annoyed that Megumin had still been using his castle for explosion practice, Verdia, after proving easily susceptible to Aqua's purification magic, summons an undead army which is quickly defeated by Megumin's explosion magic.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/303867/5466063.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"このろくでもない戦いに決着を!\"},{\"title\":\"A Second Death in This Freezing Season!\",\"number\":7,\"airDate\":\"2016-02-25\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Needing money to pay off his debts despite the freezing weather, Kazuma and his party takes on a quest to kill Snow Sprites.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/303867/5486709.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"この凍えそうな季節に二度目の死を!\"},{\"title\":\"A Loving Hand for Our Party When We Can`t Make It Through Winter!\",\"number\":8,\"airDate\":\"2016-03-03\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Kazuma and Aqua visit a magic shop run by a kind-hearted lich named Wiz, who reveals herself to be one of the Devil King's generals in charge of protecting a barrier surrounding the Devil King's castle.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/303867/5486710.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"この冬を越せない俺達に愛の手を!\"},{\"title\":\"God`s Blessing on This Wonderful Shop!\",\"number\":9,\"airDate\":\"2016-03-10\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Kazuma and his adventure friends Keith and Dust go to a shop run by succubi who provide male adventurers with much needed relief by giving them erotic dreams.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/303867/5486711.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"この素晴らしい店に祝福を!\"},{\"title\":\"Final Flame for This Over-the-Top Fortress!\",\"number\":10,\"airDate\":\"2016-03-17\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"With their members being perfectly suited for the job, Kazuma's party, along with Wiz, are chosen to lead an attack against the Destroyer.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/303867/5486712.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"この理不尽な要塞に終焔を!\"}]","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}